{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794386175662,"sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","part":{"id":"prt_1c9c026920010J6AyXIaNW7LVD","messageID":"msg_1c9bfa985001jwgXcFOTtILgxE","sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794386175663,"sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","part":{"id":"prt_1c9c02694001T3DrbxiCWM1NGq","messageID":"msg_1c9bfa985001jwgXcFOTtILgxE","sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a store finder: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` plus a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend (Tailwind styling), with SQLite storage in `./data`, served together by gunicorn on port 8000 from the root `Dockerfile`.\n- Features: public store browsing/search, geolocation-based nearby search with radius, self-drawn lat/lng plot, admin sign-in with store add/edit/delete.\n\n## Important Details\n- Contract: `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; `GET /api/stores` → `{\"items\": [...]}` with params `q`, `lat`, `lng`, `radius`; store object keys: `id`, `name`, `address`, `phone`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `distance_km`.\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 `{\"token\": ...}`); `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; missing/invalid token → 401; non-admin on `/api/admin/*` → 403.\n- Admin user is `admin` only; password from env `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup; unset/empty disables admin sign-in (login answers 401 \"admin sign-in is disabled\"). No built-in password. Username `admin` reserved at registration.\n- `PUT /api/admin/stores/{id}` replaces fields; omitted `phone` is cleared (validated as optional string, blank → NULL).\n- First start seeds 8 sample stores (IDs 1–8: Amsterdam ×2, Utrecht, Rotterdam ×2, Den Haag, Berlin, Paris) — seeding only when DB file is fresh.\n- Geo search: default radius 50 km, haversine distance rounded to 2 decimals, filtered by `distance > radius`, sorted nearest-first (tie-break name). Utrecht is ~34.5 km from Amsterdam center (my test expectation of 2 stores at radius 50 was wrong; 3 is correct).\n- Frontend styling: Tailwind v4 (`@import \"tailwindcss\";` in `frontend/src/index.css`, `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin); no other CSS files.\n- Docker install uses `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock`; lock has hashes so `--require-hashes` activates — `backend/requirements.txt` must therefore be a fully hashed pin list (done: 176 lines, same set as lock).\n- Venv for testing at `/tmp/venv3` (has flask/gunicorn installed); `/tmp/opencode` is root-owned/unwritable; external-directory rule blocks some `/tmp` writes — run commands with `workdir: /workspace` where possible.\n- Background servers via `nohup`/`pkill` caused shell timeouts; prefer in-process Flask `app.test_client()` for tests.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/requirements.txt` rewritten as full hashed pin list; `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` verified working (\"hashed install ok\").\n- `backend/app.py` written: SQLite schema (users/tokens/stores), seed, haversine, bearer-token auth, all API endpoints, SPA fallback serving `frontend/dist`, validation errors as `{\"error\": ..., \"fields\": {...}}`.\n- Full API smoke test via test client: ~40 checks pass (health, list/sort/search, geo filter + distance, 400 validation, CRUD, auth 401/403/409, delete 204/404, frontend fallback). Only 3 \"failures\" were wrong test expectations (geo radius 50 includes Utrecht — actual behavior correct).\n- Frontend deps installed and pinned exactly: tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 7.0.2, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0, vite 8.3.5, react/react-dom 19.3.1, @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1; `package.json` reorganized (build tools in devDependencies, added `typecheck` script).\n- `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins), `frontend/tsconfig.json` created.\n- Frontend source written: `src/types.ts`, `src/api.ts` (ApiError with fields, localStorage token/username, listStores/login/createStore/updateStore/deleteStore), `src/components/SignIn.tsx`, `src/components/StoreForm.tsx`, `src/components/StorePlot.tsx` (SVG scatter plot with grid/labels/legend, visitor marker), `src/App.tsx` (search debounce, geolocation with radius selector + permission-denied note, admin add/edit/delete-with-confirmation), `src/main.tsx` (imports `./index.css`).\n\n### Active\n- Todo list: backend + API test done; frontend deps/config done; \"Build React frontend\" files written but not yet verified; final build/e2e verification pending.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run `npm install`/`npm ci` to sync `frontend/package-lock.json` with the rewritten `package.json`, then `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` in `/workspace/frontend` to verify the build produces `frontend/dist`.\n2. Smoke-test full stack (gunicorn or in-process app) — `GET /api/health`, `GET /` serves built HTML, API endpoints — and finish the todo list; optionally clean leftover `data/`/`.server.log` from testing.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static serving + SQLite/seed (written, tested).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: full hashed pin list (fixed for Docker hash-checking mode).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: constraints file used by Dockerfile (unchanged).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app`, `./data` persistent).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`: deps pinned; lock needs regeneration to match.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`: build/typecheck config.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`, `src/api.ts`, `src/types.ts`, `src/index.css`, `src/main.tsx`: frontend core.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/SignIn.tsx`, `StoreForm.tsx`, `StorePlot.tsx`: UI components.","time":{"start":1794386175636,"end":1794386175640}}}
