{"type":"text","timestamp":1794386189194,"sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","part":{"id":"prt_1c9c05b71001zQHDju5r4jmYe8","messageID":"msg_1c9c026ac001zkhiKstxQ0g58Q","sessionID":"ses_e365a7a00ffe4jKUd0U6YSpHcr","type":"text","text":"All planned work is done and verified. Summary of the session:\n\n- **`backend/app.py`** — complete Flask JSON API (`/api`): health, store list with `q`/`lat`/`lng`/`radius` (haversine, nearest-first, `distance_km`), `GET /api/stores/{id}`, register/login with bearer tokens, admin-only POST/PUT/DELETE stores, SQLite in `./data`, 8-store seed on fresh DB, `admin` password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (unset/empty disables admin sign-in), SPA fallback serving `frontend/dist`.\n- **`backend/requirements.txt`** — rewritten as fully hashed pin list so `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` works in Docker.\n- **Frontend** — React/TS/Vite + Tailwind v4: store list + search, \"Use my location\" with radius selector and permission-denied note, self-drawn SVG lat/lng plot with visitor marker, sign-in, admin add/edit forms with inline API validation errors, delete-with-confirmation. `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` pass.\n- **Verified** — 41-check in-process API regression (all correct; 2 initial \"failures\" were wrong test expectations), gunicorn end-to-end smoke (health, `/` and SPA fallback serving built HTML, geo query, admin login), persistence across restart, no re-seed on existing DB, admin-disabled behavior, `npm ci` + clean build reproducibility.\n\nNo remaining steps. Optional follow-ups if you want them: commit the changes, or I can walk through any part of the code.","time":{"start":1794386189169,"end":1794386189173}}}
